  unitName: Golem Megalam
  unitId: 30932
  unitNumber: 1598
  description: Magically-animated puppets found in Rokkzalm, normally engaged in
    preservation of and repairs on the ruins. However, should combat break out, all
    available puppets will enter formation to disrupt and drive back enemies with
    precisely-coordinated attacks. These puppets feature a magical defensive barrier
    that reinforces their outer shells, making them extremely durable. They are apparently
    powered by the crystals in their midsections, and the relative fragility of these
    power sources marks them as prime targets.
